     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Meena covered a leaf with black paper and found it paler after a week.\n\"It missed the light,\" said her teacher."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
